Package: txsos
Title: Texas Secretary of State Precinct-Level Election Returns
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Shiro", "Kuriwaki", , "shirokuriwaki@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Written entirely by Cursor with guidance from Shiro Kuriwaki.
    Builds a precinct-level (voting-district) database of Texas primary and
    general election returns. Secretary of State historical returns reach
    back to 1992, but at the statewide and county-canvass level; the
    machine-readable precinct/VTD returns from the Capitol Data Portal that
    this package ingests currently cover the even-year general and primary
    cycles from 2012 to 2024, while earlier precinct-level records
    (1972-2004) survive only as Texas State Archives holdings. Returns are
    stored as Parquet and aligned to the CAGE candidate-naming format for
    validation.
